# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Email — Brevo (HTTPS API, official @getbrevo/brevo SDK)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BREVO_API_KEY is a SECRET — set it in the Railway dashboard only, never here.
#   Railway → service → Variables → BREVO_API_KEY = xkeysib-...
# Create a v3 API key at https://app.brevo.com/settings/keys/api
# (an SMTP key will NOT work — it must be an API key.)
#
# EMAIL_FROM must be a VERIFIED sender in Brevo, otherwise every send is
# rejected. Verify it at https://app.brevo.com/senders (Brevo emails a
# confirmation link to the address), or verify the whole domain at
# https://app.brevo.com/senders/domain and use any address on it.
